          "path": "evidence/frames/inspected/03-make-unpleasant-shoots-edible.jpg",
          "caption": "画面展示从苦涩原料到可食用形态的处理路径，关键转折是“能不能入口”取决于处理，而不只是取决于竹林是否存在。",
          "knowledge_refs": [
            "ku-preservation-fermentation",
            "ku-edible-varieties"
          ],
          "evidence_refs": [
            "ev-frame-edible-threshold"
          ],
          "source_spans": [
